<title>CHINA: Shanghai Hero '97 half-yr net up 4.6pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Hero '97 half-yr net up 4.6pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		  245.569	 vs   202.676</p>
<p> Net profit		 32.599	 vs    31.176</p>
<p> Net asset per share     2.86  yuan  vs     2.60</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.198 yuan  vs     0.218</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Hero Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement issued by the Shanghai Stock Exchange on Monday. The figures are based on domestic accounting standards.</p>
<p>Trading in the company's A and B shares would be suspended on Tuesday morning and resume in the afternoon, the statement said.</p>
</text>
